WEBVTT

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:07.831
Ten months ago, the crew
of Voyager was pulled

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.365
into the Delta Quadrant by an
entity known as the Caretaker.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.877
Not enough time!

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.937
When he died, Voyager's
best chance of getting home

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:19.384
died with him, but he revealed
one hopeful possibility.

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.386
There is another like me.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.388
She left hundreds of years ago,

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:24.913
but she's out there, somewhere.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:54.877
Open yourself
to the impressions around you...

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:56.980
the thoughts...

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:00.049
the minds that are on this ship.

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.630
What do you hear?

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:09.969
Voices.

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:12.733
So many voices.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.740
I believe you are sensing

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:18.073
the thoughts of various
crew members on board.

00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:19.772
What should I do?

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:22.976
See if you can isolate
one of the voices.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:26.280
Imagine you are
listening to a symphony

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:30.881
and focusing
on a single instrument.

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:32.949
It's working.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:36.723
Try to maintain
your emotional equanimity.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:40.722
You should not be concerned
with success or failure.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.132
Uh-oh.

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:43.897
He's taking off too much.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:46.997
I told him just a few
millimeters off the top.

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.665
Way too much now.

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:50.676
Don't touch the sideburns.

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:52.109
It's Neelix!

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:54.113
I can hear Neelix's thoughts.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:56.945
That is not unexpected.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.575
You have an emotional
attachment to him

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.813
which may have
drawn your focus.

00:02:00.854 --> 00:02:02.583
My scalp itches.

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:05.955
Maybe I should tell him
about that shampoo of his.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.960
I think he's getting a haircut.

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:10.622
Oh, no! He's trimming
the ear hairs.

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:13.791
I told him the ear hairs
are the perfect length.

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.300
Not the ear hairs!

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:19.234
If you are to succeed

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.570
in honing
your telepathic abilities,

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:24.975
you must learn to control
these emotional outbursts.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.978
Outburst?

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:29.071
It was a giggle.

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:35.780
Tomorrow, I will teach you
a Vulcan mind-control technique

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:38.347
that will help you
inhibit your giggles.

00:02:41.528 --> 00:02:42.995
Thanks, Tuvok.

00:02:43.029 --> 00:02:44.519
You may go.

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:51.437
You're late.

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.530
Sorry. My lesson
with Lieutenant Tuvok

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:55.165
went a little long today.

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:57.005
Today, yesterday
and the day before.

00:02:57.043 --> 00:03:00.103
You'd think a Vulcan would be
more attuned to punctuality.

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:03.206
I'll try to keep a closer eye
on the time from now on.

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:04.546
So, how was school today?

00:03:04.584 --> 00:03:07.382
Wonderful. Tuvok helped me
with a sensory focus exercise,

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.217
we worked
on my precognitive skills,

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:12.156
and I learned how to self-induce
a hypergogic mental state.

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:13.955
Sounds stimulating.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:16.427
He says I'm making
excellent progress.

00:03:18.665 --> 00:03:22.294
I had no doubt that you would,
but I'd appreciate it

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:24.963
if you wouldn't let
these... mind studies

00:03:25.004 --> 00:03:26.801
interfere with your...

00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:32.978
What's that?

00:03:33.012 --> 00:03:34.570
I don't know.

00:06:04.228 --> 00:06:05.923
Life-signs?

00:06:05.963 --> 00:06:07.191
Apparently so.

00:06:07.231 --> 00:06:09.199
But before I could analyze them,

00:06:09.233 --> 00:06:11.030
the life-signs simply ceased.

00:06:11.068 --> 00:06:15.027
I'm scanning the remains on
all biospectral frequencies.

00:06:15.072 --> 00:06:18.405
It's completely inert.
Dead.

00:06:18.442 --> 00:06:20.410
Somehow, I find it
hard to believe

00:06:20.444 --> 00:06:22.742
this rock suddenly came to life
for several seconds.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:24.179
I concur.

00:06:24.215 --> 00:06:25.944
However, dead or alive,

00:06:26.016 --> 00:06:27.881
these are the remains
of an alien entity

00:06:27.918 --> 00:06:29.545
we never fully understood.

00:06:29.587 --> 00:06:31.054
It may be prudent to place it

00:06:31.088 --> 00:06:33.113
in a level-3 biohazard
containment field.

00:06:33.157 --> 00:06:35.387
Agreed... but first,
I want to take a look at...

00:06:38.095 --> 00:06:39.756
I'm picking up life-signs.

00:06:39.797 --> 00:06:41.162
They're sporocystian.

00:06:41.198 --> 00:06:43.723
The Caretaker was
a sporocystian life-form.

00:06:43.768 --> 00:06:46.236
But, according to my readings,

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.261
the life signs aren't coming
from the remains.

00:06:48.305 --> 00:06:49.795
The remains
are simply resonating

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:52.400
in response
to an external energy source...

00:06:52.443 --> 00:06:53.808
some other life-form.

00:06:53.844 --> 00:06:55.106
Where?

00:06:55.146 --> 00:06:56.272
Let's find out.

00:06:56.313 --> 00:06:57.541
Janeway to Bridge.

00:06:57.581 --> 00:07:00.516
Mr. Kim, begin scans
for a sporocystian life-form.

00:07:00.551 --> 00:07:02.348
Aye, Captain. Stand by.

00:07:06.056 --> 00:07:07.523
I've got it, Captain.

00:07:07.558 --> 00:07:09.423
A sporocystian energy burst

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:12.020
approximately
ten light-years distant.

00:07:12.062 --> 00:07:15.399
But I can't get a precise fix
on its location.

00:07:18.735 --> 00:07:20.669
The life-signs are gone.

00:07:20.704 --> 00:07:23.434
These remains
could be responding

00:07:23.473 --> 00:07:25.441
to the Caretaker's mate.

00:07:25.475 --> 00:07:30.310
If that's true, maybe we could
use them to track her down.

00:07:30.347 --> 00:07:33.043
And if we can find her,
she might have

00:07:33.083 --> 00:07:35.074
the ability to send us home.

00:07:38.789 --> 00:07:39.881
Torres to Janeway.

00:07:39.923 --> 00:07:40.947
Go ahead.

00:07:40.991 --> 00:07:42.481
We've placed the remains

00:07:42.526 --> 00:07:44.084
in a hexiprismatic field,
Captain.

00:07:44.127 --> 00:07:47.119
The next time it responds to
sporocystian energy, the field

00:07:47.164 --> 00:07:49.223
should give us a heading
to the source.

00:07:49.266 --> 00:07:50.961
You're using the remains
like a compass.

00:07:51.001 --> 00:07:51.899
Exactly.

00:07:51.935 --> 00:07:52.902
Good work.

00:07:52.936 --> 00:07:54.233
Keep us apprised.

00:07:54.271 --> 00:07:56.102
Janeway out.

00:07:57.707 --> 00:08:00.267
Captain, the Caretaker
was a being

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.641
of considerable power,

00:08:01.678 --> 00:08:03.873
and although his intent
was not hostile,

00:08:03.914 --> 00:08:05.905
we were essentially
at his mercy.

00:08:05.949 --> 00:08:08.417
I do not care to repeat
that experience.

00:08:08.452 --> 00:08:10.716
And if we are
about to meet his mate,

00:08:10.754 --> 00:08:12.517
you'd like it to be
on more even ground.

00:08:12.556 --> 00:08:13.648
Precisely.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.021
I have studied the Doctor's

00:08:15.058 --> 00:08:17.390
biochemical analysis
of the Caretaker remains,

00:08:17.427 --> 00:08:20.692
and I believe it is possible
to create a sporocystian toxin...

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.358
something which might
debilitate the life-form.

00:08:27.437 --> 00:08:29.029
Sounds like
a sensible precaution.

00:08:29.072 --> 00:08:30.403
Get on it.

00:08:31.741 --> 00:08:34.209
I'm picking up
sporocystian energy.

00:08:34.244 --> 00:08:35.541
Chakotay to Engineering.

00:08:35.579 --> 00:08:36.944
We're picking up life-signs.

00:08:37.047 --> 00:08:38.344
Is your compass working?

00:08:38.381 --> 00:08:39.348
Stand by.

00:08:39.382 --> 00:08:41.179
Activate the field.

00:08:44.621 --> 00:08:46.714
I can't get a bearing
on the source.

00:08:46.756 --> 00:08:48.951
Try increasing
the spatial resolution.

00:08:49.025 --> 00:08:51.789
Spatial resolution at maximum.

00:08:51.828 --> 00:08:54.353
The life-signs are fading,
and I still can't get

00:08:54.397 --> 00:08:56.228
a lock on the coordinates.

00:08:56.266 --> 00:08:58.200
Boosting the signal gain.

00:09:00.403 --> 00:09:01.893
We've got it, Captain.

00:09:01.938 --> 00:09:04.406
Bearing 272 mark 19.

00:09:04.441 --> 00:09:06.238
Acknowledged.

00:09:06.276 --> 00:09:10.007
Mr. Paris, set a course
and engage at maximum warp.

00:09:10.046 --> 00:09:11.377
Aye, Captain.

00:09:19.756 --> 00:09:22.452
Captain, we're picking up
an artificial structure

00:09:22.492 --> 00:09:24.756
on long-range sensors.

00:09:24.794 --> 00:09:27.695
It appears to be
a space station of some kind.

00:09:27.731 --> 00:09:29.631
Slow to impulse
and put it on screen.

00:09:37.674 --> 00:09:40.006
That looks a lot like
the Caretaker's Array.

00:09:41.578 --> 00:09:43.068
The configuration is similar.

00:09:44.648 --> 00:09:46.172
So is the surface composition,

00:09:46.216 --> 00:09:48.116
but it's only
about one-tenth the size.

00:09:48.151 --> 00:09:51.120
Are there any sporocystian
life-forms on board?

00:09:51.154 --> 00:09:56.148
No, but I am picking up over
2,000 carbon-based life-forms.

00:09:57.294 --> 00:09:58.727
They appear to be...

00:09:58.762 --> 00:10:00.889
Wait a second.

00:10:00.931 --> 00:10:02.990
Confirming.

00:10:04.434 --> 00:10:06.402
Captain...

00:10:06.436 --> 00:10:08.370
they're Ocampa.

00:10:10.173 --> 00:10:11.765
We're approaching
the station, Captain.

00:10:11.808 --> 00:10:13.105
All stop.

00:10:13.143 --> 00:10:14.804
Hail them, Mr. Tuvok.

00:10:16.546 --> 00:10:17.979
No response.

00:10:18.048 --> 00:10:21.176
I am reading an energy surge
from the station...

00:10:21.217 --> 00:10:22.514
possibly weapons.

00:10:22.552 --> 00:10:23.678
Shields.

00:10:29.025 --> 00:10:31.084
Definitely weapons.

00:10:31.127 --> 00:10:32.685
Shields are holding.

00:10:32.729 --> 00:10:33.855
Incoming message from the Array.

00:10:33.897 --> 00:10:35.262
Let's hear it.

00:10:37.734 --> 00:10:39.429
You're not wanted here.

00:10:43.306 --> 00:10:44.933
We pose no threat to you.

00:10:44.975 --> 00:10:47.273
I'm Captain Kathryn
Janeway of the...

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.834
You have been warned!

00:11:03.759 --> 00:11:05.226
They are Ocampa?

00:11:05.261 --> 00:11:06.228
That's right.

00:11:06.262 --> 00:11:09.163
There appears to be
an entire colony.

00:11:09.198 --> 00:11:11.166
And, according to our sensors,

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:14.328
the station is
at least 300 years old.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:16.338
Kes, is there any Ocampa history

00:11:16.372 --> 00:11:18.340
about people
who left your planet

00:11:18.374 --> 00:11:21.673
or were captured by aliens
and taken away?

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:22.972
No.

00:11:23.045 --> 00:11:25.275
The idea
that there could be Ocampa

00:11:25.314 --> 00:11:26.941
anywhere but on the homeworld

00:11:26.982 --> 00:11:28.950
is something
no one ever considered.

00:11:28.984 --> 00:11:31.248
I thought I was the only one.

00:11:31.287 --> 00:11:34.381
Since you're definitely
the only one on Voyager,

00:11:34.423 --> 00:11:36.653
I want you to act
as an intermediary.

00:11:36.692 --> 00:11:37.989
Gladly.

00:11:38.027 --> 00:11:39.358
What should I do?

00:11:39.395 --> 00:11:41.693
The first step
is to arrange a meeting.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:43.595
Let's see
if we can get that far.

00:11:43.632 --> 00:11:45.122
Hail the Array.

00:11:46.869 --> 00:11:48.427
This is becoming tiresome,
Captain.

00:11:48.471 --> 00:11:50.871
If you force us to take
further aggressive action...

00:11:50.906 --> 00:11:54.342
I have someone here
who wishes to speak with you.

00:12:00.015 --> 00:12:01.642
My name is Kes.

00:12:01.684 --> 00:12:03.208
I'm an Ocampa.

00:12:03.252 --> 00:12:06.221
This is some kind of trick.

00:12:06.255 --> 00:12:08.052
I assure you it's not a trick.

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:11.548
What would an Ocampa be doing
on an alien starship?

00:12:11.594 --> 00:12:13.562
It's a long story.

00:12:13.596 --> 00:12:16.827
But I'd like to know
what an Ocampa is doing

00:12:16.866 --> 00:12:18.663
on an alien space station.

00:12:18.701 --> 00:12:21.363
That is also a long story.

00:12:21.403 --> 00:12:24.964
Then I suggest we meet
and tell each other our stories.

00:12:25.074 --> 00:12:27.304
May we come aboard
your station?

00:12:27.343 --> 00:12:30.835
No, but I am willing
to come to your ship.

00:12:38.254 --> 00:12:39.846
Our readings identified

00:12:39.889 --> 00:12:42.153
a sporocystian life-form
in this area.

00:12:42.191 --> 00:12:44.887
We've been looking for
that life-form for months.

00:12:44.927 --> 00:12:47.259
Why? To destroy it?

00:12:47.296 --> 00:12:48.854
No.

00:12:48.898 --> 00:12:52.197
On the contrary, we believe
it has the technology

00:12:52.234 --> 00:12:54.225
that could send us home.

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:58.639
Captain, are you aware
of how your ship is regarded?

00:12:58.674 --> 00:13:02.201
That when Voyager appears,
people fear destruction?

00:13:02.244 --> 00:13:05.236
Your ship is known
as a ship of death.

00:13:06.248 --> 00:13:08.216
What?

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.309
You've established
quite a reputation.

00:13:10.352 --> 00:13:12.149
You killed the Caretaker,

00:13:12.188 --> 00:13:14.952
declared war on the Kazon,
raided planets

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:16.651
for their resources.

00:13:16.692 --> 00:13:18.319
None of that is true.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.920
We've never attacked anyone
except in self-defense.

00:13:20.963 --> 00:13:22.954
And we did not
kill the Caretaker.

00:13:23.065 --> 00:13:24.726
He died of natural causes.

00:13:24.767 --> 00:13:27.668
Mr. Tanis, please
try to understand,

00:13:27.703 --> 00:13:29.671
we only want to find the entity
we've been looking for.

00:13:29.705 --> 00:13:32.230
I want to talk to you alone.

00:13:32.274 --> 00:13:35.801
Our sensors tell us she's
somewhere in this region.

00:13:35.844 --> 00:13:38.244
Can you help us find her?

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:41.010
Captain, I'd like to speak
to Tanis alone, if I may.

00:13:43.385 --> 00:13:45.376
Very well.

00:13:51.460 --> 00:13:53.587
Why should I believe
any of this?

00:13:53.629 --> 00:13:56.120
These are kind people, Tanis.

00:13:56.165 --> 00:13:59.134
They saved my life,
at great risk to themselves,

00:13:59.168 --> 00:14:01.636
when they didn't have to.

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.729
They wouldn't lie to you.

00:14:06.675 --> 00:14:11.135
I will admit, these people
are hardly what I expected.

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:15.640
But more unexpected
was finding you here, Kes.

00:14:15.684 --> 00:14:20.348
I had no idea any Ocampa had
left the homeworld so recently.

00:14:20.389 --> 00:14:23.119
I have about a thousand
questions to ask you.

00:14:23.158 --> 00:14:27.390
I know, and I'm going
to try to answer them.

00:14:27.429 --> 00:14:29.727
Is this where you
spend your time?

00:14:29.765 --> 00:14:31.426
You mean in this room?

00:14:31.467 --> 00:14:32.764
No.

00:14:32.801 --> 00:14:35.235
This is where the Bridge
officers usually meet.

00:14:35.271 --> 00:14:37.831
I want to see where you live.

00:14:37.873 --> 00:14:41.331
I want to see the place
that is special to you.

00:14:42.911 --> 00:14:44.503
You did all this?

00:14:44.546 --> 00:14:47.811
I had a little help,
but, yes, most of it is my work.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.408
Well, you've done well...

00:14:49.451 --> 00:14:52.978
bringing something so beautiful
into a place so sterile.

00:14:53.022 --> 00:14:54.649
Sterile.

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:55.987
Voyager?

00:14:56.058 --> 00:14:58.117
Look around you, Kes.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.628
This is a cold and barren place.

00:15:00.663 --> 00:15:03.131
There are
over 150 people on board.

00:15:03.165 --> 00:15:05.190
I'd hardly call that barren.

00:15:05.234 --> 00:15:09.136
There are people,
but there's so little life.

00:15:09.171 --> 00:15:12.470
Part of me weeps
to see you in this place.

00:15:12.508 --> 00:15:14.476
You're so isolated.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.478
Corridors, bulkheads...

00:15:16.512 --> 00:15:19.481
all cutting you off
from the world around you.

00:15:19.515 --> 00:15:21.483
You live on a space station.

00:15:21.517 --> 00:15:23.212
How is it any different?

00:15:23.252 --> 00:15:25.686
I assure you,
it's very different.

00:15:27.022 --> 00:15:29.217
You're very young, aren't you?

00:15:29.258 --> 00:15:30.953
Two years.

00:15:31.026 --> 00:15:35.224
Would it surprise you
to know that I'm 14 years old?

00:15:35.264 --> 00:15:37.164
That's not possible.

00:15:37.199 --> 00:15:40.225
The oldest Ocampa
only lived to be nine.

00:15:40.269 --> 00:15:43.170
You know so little
about your own people.

00:15:43.205 --> 00:15:46.174
There's so much for you
to learn about yourself...

00:15:46.208 --> 00:15:48.176
about the galaxy.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:51.668
Being here on this ship
is holding you back.

00:15:51.714 --> 00:15:54.182
These people are helping me.

00:15:54.216 --> 00:15:56.480
I'm a member of the crew.

00:15:57.486 --> 00:15:59.784
I suppose
we were like you once...

00:15:59.822 --> 00:16:02.791
innocent, naive.

00:16:02.825 --> 00:16:05.453
But when Suspiria
brought us here 300 years ago,

00:16:05.494 --> 00:16:08.122
she began to teach us
how we could become stronger

00:16:08.163 --> 00:16:10.495
than we ever could've
on the homeworld.

00:16:10.532 --> 00:16:13.194
Suspiria... is that
your Caretaker?

00:16:13.235 --> 00:16:15.931
We don't think of her
as a Caretaker.

00:16:16.004 --> 00:16:18.529
Her species is actually
called the Nacene.

00:16:18.574 --> 00:16:20.201
Then you do know her.

00:16:20.242 --> 00:16:21.573
Where is she?

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:23.942
Nearby.

00:16:23.979 --> 00:16:26.948
But she's so different
from the entity you knew.

00:16:27.015 --> 00:16:31.645
He was only interested
in maintaining the status quo.

00:16:31.687 --> 00:16:35.145
He kept our people
servile and weak.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:39.820
Suspiria taught us to develop
our psychokinetic skills

00:16:39.862 --> 00:16:42.831
that had lain dormant
for so long.

00:16:42.865 --> 00:16:46.824
We have abilities far beyond
anything you can imagine.

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:50.661
Like what?

00:16:57.346 --> 00:16:59.906
We can enhance life.

00:16:59.948 --> 00:17:02.041
And that's only
the beginning, Kes.

00:17:28.243 --> 00:17:30.643
I have to return
to the station.

00:17:30.679 --> 00:17:32.840
We'll talk again.

00:17:47.229 --> 00:17:49.857
Sounds like you've established
a dialogue with Tanis.

00:17:49.898 --> 00:17:51.422
It's an excellent beginning.

00:17:51.467 --> 00:17:52.957
Good work.

00:17:53.035 --> 00:17:54.696
Thank you, Captain.

00:17:54.736 --> 00:17:56.067
Kes...

00:17:58.207 --> 00:18:00.175
is there something wrong?

00:18:00.209 --> 00:18:02.609
Not exactly.

00:18:02.644 --> 00:18:06.102
I'm just a little overwhelmed.

00:18:06.148 --> 00:18:09.117
I always believed that
my people had the potential

00:18:09.151 --> 00:18:11.449
to be more than what they were...

00:18:11.487 --> 00:18:14.115
that our mental abilities
could be somehow heightened...

00:18:14.156 --> 00:18:17.125
and now I've met someone
who's realized that potential

00:18:17.159 --> 00:18:20.617
and I don't know whether
to be excited or frightened.

00:18:20.662 --> 00:18:23.187
A nonemotional response
would be more useful.

00:18:23.232 --> 00:18:25.462
But since you're not a Vulcan,

00:18:25.501 --> 00:18:28.129
I'd say a mixture
of the two emotions

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.138
would be appropriate.

00:18:30.172 --> 00:18:33.630
It's an exciting moment, Kes,
and I'm very happy for you.

00:18:33.675 --> 00:18:35.142
But just remember,

00:18:35.177 --> 00:18:37.270
we know very little
about these Ocampa.

00:18:37.312 --> 00:18:40.145
Be cautious in your dealings
with Tanis.

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.945
I will.

00:18:43.018 --> 00:18:46.010
But I just have
a good feeling about him.

00:19:06.642 --> 00:19:09.270
I've met with the Ocampa girl.

00:19:09.311 --> 00:19:11.245
She has potential.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:13.214
I don't care about the girl.

00:19:13.248 --> 00:19:14.738
She's yours.

00:19:14.783 --> 00:19:16.512
Bring me the ship.

00:19:23.258 --> 00:19:24.725
This is delicious!

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:29.720
Mr. Tanis, is it true
you're 14 years old?

00:19:29.765 --> 00:19:33.758
Yes. That's quite common
with my people here.

00:19:33.802 --> 00:19:35.861
Suspiria helped us
develop a technology

00:19:35.904 --> 00:19:40.102
to extend the Ocampa life span
three generations ago.

00:19:40.142 --> 00:19:42.702
My father lived to be 20 years.

00:19:42.744 --> 00:19:45.770
Would that technology
work for Kes?

00:19:45.814 --> 00:19:47.475
Possibly.

00:19:47.516 --> 00:19:49.507
Where does Suspiria live?

00:19:49.551 --> 00:19:51.178
On another Array?

00:19:51.219 --> 00:19:53.517
Oh, nothing
so corporeal as that.

00:19:53.555 --> 00:19:55.955
She exists as pure
sporocystian energy.

00:19:56.058 --> 00:19:57.787
She only assumes physical form

00:19:57.826 --> 00:20:00.386
when we need
to communicate with her.

00:20:00.429 --> 00:20:02.693
Does she occupy
our space-time continuum?

00:20:02.731 --> 00:20:04.198
I don't know.

00:20:04.232 --> 00:20:06.962
All I know is, when we
need her, she comes.

00:20:07.035 --> 00:20:09.299
I'll take you
to the meeting place.

00:20:09.338 --> 00:20:12.603
I'm sure all your questions
will be answered then.

00:20:12.641 --> 00:20:14.632
You'll enjoy meeting her, Kes,

00:20:14.676 --> 00:20:16.701
as well
as the other Ocampa here.

00:20:16.745 --> 00:20:19.543
I'd love to visit the station.

00:20:19.581 --> 00:20:21.139
Visit? Why not stay with us?

00:20:23.218 --> 00:20:24.446
Stay?

00:20:24.486 --> 00:20:25.976
Yes. I think you could

00:20:26.088 --> 00:20:28.682
learn a lot from us,
we from you.

00:20:28.724 --> 00:20:31.921
We haven't been in contact
with the Ocampa homeworld

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.621
for hundreds of years.

00:20:33.662 --> 00:20:35.892
We'd be fascinated to hear
about our distant cousins.

00:20:35.931 --> 00:20:38.365
That sounds wonderful,
but, uh...

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.631
Kes, you certainly
don't have to decide

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.968
something this important
right now.

00:20:44.005 --> 00:20:45.700
Give it some thought.

00:20:47.275 --> 00:20:50.574
She's absolutely right.
There's no rush.

00:20:50.612 --> 00:20:53.206
I appreciate that.

00:20:53.248 --> 00:20:55.273
I am curious
about your mental abilities.

00:20:55.317 --> 00:20:57.114
They're so much greater
than mine.

00:20:57.152 --> 00:21:00.019
Do not underestimate
your own potential, Kes.

00:21:00.122 --> 00:21:02.488
Your mental abilities
are rapidly maturing.

00:21:02.524 --> 00:21:05.322
I might be able to help you.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.521
No offense to Mr. Tuvok,

00:21:07.562 --> 00:21:10.963
but I am more familiar
with the Ocampa mind.

00:21:11.032 --> 00:21:13.728
I would appreciate any insight
you could give me.

00:21:13.769 --> 00:21:16.602
Oh, good.
Maybe later this evening.

00:21:20.909 --> 00:21:23.309
It is a highly reactive
sporocystian toxin.

00:21:23.345 --> 00:21:25.939
I ran a micro-cellular
analysis

00:21:25.981 --> 00:21:29.144
of the Caretaker's remains,
and discovered a critical enzyme

00:21:29.184 --> 00:21:30.481
in his cellular structure.

00:21:30.519 --> 00:21:31.486
The energy in this cylinder

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:33.613
is formulated to break
down that enzyme.

00:21:33.655 --> 00:21:35.816
It would result
in temporary paralysis.

00:21:35.857 --> 00:21:37.882
Mr. Tanis says she's harmless.

00:21:37.926 --> 00:21:40.417
It is my hope
that we only have to use it

00:21:40.462 --> 00:21:41.986
as a precautionary measure.

00:21:42.063 --> 00:21:44.725
Very well. Proceed.

00:21:49.104 --> 00:21:52.369
In your mind,
visualize your hand.

00:21:52.407 --> 00:21:54.432
Now reach out with that hand

00:21:54.476 --> 00:21:56.000
and grab the teacup.

00:21:56.111 --> 00:21:59.842
Reach out
with the fingers of your mind.

00:21:59.881 --> 00:22:01.212
Grasp it.

00:22:05.487 --> 00:22:06.954
Do you have it?

00:22:07.055 --> 00:22:08.955
I can feel the handle

00:22:09.024 --> 00:22:12.084
and the texture of the metal,
but I can't move it.

00:22:12.127 --> 00:22:13.924
Don't try to move it.

00:22:13.962 --> 00:22:15.953
Just take a drink from it.

00:22:25.607 --> 00:22:27.199
See?

00:22:27.242 --> 00:22:28.470
You can do it.

00:22:28.510 --> 00:22:30.740
I don't understand.
I didn't try to move it.

00:22:30.779 --> 00:22:33.475
No. You just tried to drink
from it.

00:22:33.515 --> 00:22:36.882
And what would you do
if you wanted to take a drink?

00:22:36.918 --> 00:22:38.476
I'd reach out and pick it up.

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:39.817
That's right.

00:22:39.855 --> 00:22:42.153
But you wouldn't be thinking
about picking it up.

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:43.555
You'd simply do it.

00:22:43.592 --> 00:22:46.356
And that's
what you just learned.

00:22:46.394 --> 00:22:49.363
Focus on the goal, not the task.

00:22:49.397 --> 00:22:52.525
When you wanted the tea,
it came to you.

00:22:52.567 --> 00:22:54.432
Uh, excuse me...

00:22:54.469 --> 00:22:57.029
We're not finished.

00:22:58.607 --> 00:22:59.904
I know you're tired,

00:22:59.941 --> 00:23:02.307
but I want you to try
one more thing.

00:23:04.446 --> 00:23:06.107
It's cold.

00:23:06.147 --> 00:23:09.514
Wouldn't it taste better
if it were hot?

00:23:15.323 --> 00:23:17.154
See past the liquid.

00:23:17.192 --> 00:23:18.853
Not with your eyes,
with your mind.

00:23:18.894 --> 00:23:23.263
What your eyes show you
is only the surface of reality.

00:23:23.298 --> 00:23:25.198
Look deeper.

00:23:27.302 --> 00:23:28.963
There is no liquid.

00:23:29.037 --> 00:23:30.732
There is no cup.

00:23:30.772 --> 00:23:34.538
There's only a collection
of molecules and atoms,

00:23:34.576 --> 00:23:37.477
moving, vibrating...

00:23:43.885 --> 00:23:45.352
I see them.

00:23:45.387 --> 00:23:46.945
They're barely moving.

00:23:46.988 --> 00:23:49.320
That's because they're cold.

00:23:49.357 --> 00:23:51.257
How would you heat them up?

00:23:51.293 --> 00:23:53.761
With... a fire.

00:23:53.795 --> 00:23:55.285
That's right...

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:57.298
with the fire of your mind.

00:23:57.332 --> 00:23:59.300
How do I do that?

00:23:59.334 --> 00:24:02.565
Focus on the goal,
not the task.

00:24:02.604 --> 00:24:06.700
Don't think about creating
the fire, just use it.

00:24:30.966 --> 00:24:32.399
I see it now.

00:24:32.434 --> 00:24:33.833
It's so simple.

00:24:33.868 --> 00:24:36.132
That's right.

00:24:36.171 --> 00:24:38.162
But that's enough for tonight.

00:24:38.206 --> 00:24:40.970
Tomorrow, I'll take you
to the next level.

00:24:41.009 --> 00:24:43.409
Until then, good night.

00:24:51.119 --> 00:24:53.144
May I say something now?

00:24:53.188 --> 00:24:55.315
Of course, Neelix.

00:24:58.226 --> 00:25:00.751
I'm so proud of you.

00:25:00.795 --> 00:25:04.094
I knew you could do it.

00:25:04.132 --> 00:25:07.101
This is a whole new
beginning for you, Kes.

00:25:07.135 --> 00:25:09.729
I know, I know.

00:25:09.771 --> 00:25:11.432
What if I did go?

00:25:12.474 --> 00:25:14.066
Go?

00:25:14.109 --> 00:25:15.633
To the Ocampa Array.

00:25:15.677 --> 00:25:19.272
If I decided to live with Tanis
and the others...

00:25:19.314 --> 00:25:20.906
would you go with me?

00:25:23.118 --> 00:25:25.848
I'd go anywhere with you.

00:25:29.524 --> 00:25:31.924
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:25:31.960 --> 00:25:35.623
We've arrived at what Tanis
calls "the meeting place"...

00:25:35.664 --> 00:25:38.531
the region of space
where Suspiria exists.

00:25:38.566 --> 00:25:40.557
Nothing on sensors, Captain.

00:25:43.038 --> 00:25:46.565
Captain, may I access
your communications equipment?

00:25:46.608 --> 00:25:48.007
Of course.

00:25:59.621 --> 00:26:02.021
I've sent out
a subspace carrier wave.

00:26:02.057 --> 00:26:04.924
Suspiria should respond
within the next 47 hours.

00:26:04.959 --> 00:26:06.426
I'll be in my quarters.

00:26:06.461 --> 00:26:08.588
We'll let you know when
she makes her appearance.

00:26:08.630 --> 00:26:10.222
That won't be necessary.

00:26:10.265 --> 00:26:11.960
I'll know when she's here.

00:26:23.044 --> 00:26:25.569
Tanis has shown me
the next level.

00:26:25.613 --> 00:26:28.104
The psychokinetic
manipulation of matter.

00:26:28.149 --> 00:26:30.583
That is a large step
for someone

00:26:30.618 --> 00:26:33.246
whose mental abilities
are still undisciplined.

00:26:33.288 --> 00:26:35.848
Nevertheless, I am intrigued.

00:26:35.890 --> 00:26:37.084
May I?

00:26:37.125 --> 00:26:38.217
Please.

00:26:45.867 --> 00:26:49.894
He showed me how to use
the fire in my mind.

00:27:02.484 --> 00:27:04.008
Fascinating.

00:27:04.052 --> 00:27:07.351
However, I would advise caution
in exploring this ability

00:27:07.388 --> 00:27:09.049
until you have mastered the...

00:27:16.631 --> 00:27:18.462
I have to stop the fire.

00:27:18.500 --> 00:27:20.127
How do I stop the fire?!

00:27:20.168 --> 00:27:23.467
Tuvok... Tuvok,
can you tell me what to do?!

00:27:23.505 --> 00:27:24.938
Tuvok!

00:27:28.042 --> 00:27:30.272
No!

00:27:44.157 --> 00:27:47.058
Lieutenant, can you hear me?

00:27:56.035 --> 00:27:57.866
What happened?

00:27:57.904 --> 00:27:58.962
Your cell membranes

00:27:59.038 --> 00:28:01.097
went through
hyperthermal induction.

00:28:01.140 --> 00:28:02.801
The temperature of your blood

00:28:02.842 --> 00:28:05.538
rose by 37 degrees
in a matter of seconds.

00:28:05.578 --> 00:28:08.513
You were in shock,
and I resuscitated you.

00:28:08.548 --> 00:28:10.516
I'm restricting you
to light duty

00:28:10.550 --> 00:28:12.017
for the next three days.

00:28:12.051 --> 00:28:13.643
Try and get some rest.

00:28:14.654 --> 00:28:16.918
That will not be necessary,
Doctor.

00:28:16.989 --> 00:28:19.253
My Vulcan healing techniques
do not require

00:28:19.292 --> 00:28:21.658
an extended period
of convalescence.

00:28:23.129 --> 00:28:25.654
Vulcans make the worst patients.

00:28:27.667 --> 00:28:31.501
Fine, but if you're feeling
any nausea or dizziness,

00:28:31.537 --> 00:28:33.505
I'm expecting you
to report to Sick Bay at once.

00:28:33.539 --> 00:28:34.972
Of course.

00:28:36.909 --> 00:28:37.876
Tuvok, I'm sor...

00:28:37.910 --> 00:28:39.673
You are probably
feeling the emotion

00:28:39.712 --> 00:28:42.203
known as remorse,
possibly guilt.

00:28:42.248 --> 00:28:44.273
I advise you to look
on this incident

00:28:44.317 --> 00:28:45.750
as a learning experience.

00:28:45.785 --> 00:28:47.184
It's not that easy.

00:28:47.220 --> 00:28:48.687
I almost killed you.

00:28:48.721 --> 00:28:51.315
That is correct,
but you did not.

00:28:51.357 --> 00:28:53.257
Try to remember that.

00:28:53.292 --> 00:28:56.261
I will see you tomorrow
at 1500 hours,

00:28:56.295 --> 00:28:59.093
assuming you wish to continue
your training.

00:28:59.132 --> 00:29:01.123
You still want to teach me?

00:29:01.167 --> 00:29:03.294
If this experience
proves anything,

00:29:03.336 --> 00:29:06.305
it is that you need
further instruction,

00:29:06.339 --> 00:29:08.000
and I would regret

00:29:08.040 --> 00:29:10.634
not continuing
as your instructor.

00:29:10.676 --> 00:29:12.837
Thanks, Tuvok.

00:29:31.464 --> 00:29:33.591
How's the Vulcan?

00:29:33.633 --> 00:29:35.726
Is he going to recover?

00:29:35.768 --> 00:29:37.133
You heard?

00:29:37.170 --> 00:29:38.933
In a manner of speaking.

00:29:38.971 --> 00:29:41.030
I was aware of what happened.

00:29:41.073 --> 00:29:43.769
He's going to be all right,
no thanks to me.

00:29:43.810 --> 00:29:46.574
Tanis, I've been thinking...

00:29:46.612 --> 00:29:48.512
I don't know
if I'm ready for this.

00:29:48.548 --> 00:29:49.674
What's wrong?

00:29:49.715 --> 00:29:51.683
If I can't control my abilities,

00:29:51.717 --> 00:29:53.685
there might be another accident.

00:29:53.719 --> 00:29:56.847
I'm afraid it isn't going
to get any easier, Kes.

00:29:56.889 --> 00:29:59.483
You're already starting
to manifest abilities

00:29:59.525 --> 00:30:01.891
far beyond anything
you've ever imagined.

00:30:01.928 --> 00:30:03.657
Soon you'll be so far

00:30:03.696 --> 00:30:05.664
beyond the other beings
on this ship

00:30:05.698 --> 00:30:08.258
that you'll look at them
as they look at... pets.

00:30:08.301 --> 00:30:09.768
They're not pets.

00:30:09.802 --> 00:30:10.769
They're people.

00:30:10.803 --> 00:30:11.963
They're my friends.

00:30:12.004 --> 00:30:14.768
And I'm sure you care
for them very much.

00:30:14.807 --> 00:30:17.105
I'm sure
they're wonderful people,

00:30:17.143 --> 00:30:19.976
and they certainly seem
that way to me, but...

00:30:20.079 --> 00:30:22.877
it's time that you began
to accept how different

00:30:22.915 --> 00:30:24.576
you are from them.

00:30:24.617 --> 00:30:26.482
The people on this ship...
they live their lives

00:30:26.519 --> 00:30:28.885
trapped inside
their primitive skulls,

00:30:28.921 --> 00:30:30.946
depending on flesh and bone

00:30:30.990 --> 00:30:33.550
to tell them
what the universe is like.

00:30:33.593 --> 00:30:37.188
They don't know what it is
to see beyond the physical.

00:30:37.230 --> 00:30:39.221
Touch it.

00:30:40.933 --> 00:30:43.493
This is how they
know their universe.

00:30:43.536 --> 00:30:45.970
They touch the flower,
their nerve impulses

00:30:46.005 --> 00:30:48.337
travel up their arm
to the brain,

00:30:48.374 --> 00:30:52.174
and in their mind, they sense
the moisture of the petals,

00:30:52.211 --> 00:30:55.442
the texture of the leaves,
the sharpness of the thorns,

00:30:55.481 --> 00:30:58.006
and they think they know
what it feels like,

00:30:58.050 --> 00:31:00.177
but they don't.

00:31:00.219 --> 00:31:02.346
Now touch it.

00:31:02.388 --> 00:31:04.720
Reach out with your thoughts.

00:31:04.757 --> 00:31:08.284
Feel it for the very first time.

00:31:10.730 --> 00:31:15.133
Think of nothing but the flower.

00:31:15.167 --> 00:31:16.964
It's the only object
in the universe.

00:31:17.036 --> 00:31:18.333
Know it.

00:31:18.371 --> 00:31:23.035
Know it in a way
only an Ocampa can.

00:31:25.545 --> 00:31:26.876
Can you see it?

00:31:26.913 --> 00:31:28.312
Yes.

00:31:28.347 --> 00:31:31.111
It's more than seeing.

00:31:31.150 --> 00:31:33.448
It's more than touching.

00:31:33.486 --> 00:31:36.649
I know this flower.

00:31:36.689 --> 00:31:37.815
You can do more.

00:31:37.857 --> 00:31:39.882
Reach out.

00:31:39.926 --> 00:31:43.453
Feel all the life in this room.

00:32:02.715 --> 00:32:04.580
Yes, I can feel it.

00:32:04.617 --> 00:32:06.312
I know them all.

00:32:06.352 --> 00:32:08.377
They're so beautiful.

00:32:08.421 --> 00:32:10.582
It can be more beautiful.

00:32:10.623 --> 00:32:12.955
Bring the fire.

00:32:47.526 --> 00:32:49.323
How did it feel?

00:32:54.100 --> 00:32:55.863
They're dead.

00:32:58.904 --> 00:33:01.372
They're all dead.

00:33:01.407 --> 00:33:03.568
Amazing.

00:33:03.609 --> 00:33:05.600
You felt life.

00:33:05.645 --> 00:33:09.274
You embraced its essence
with your mind

00:33:09.315 --> 00:33:11.249
and then you transformed it.

00:33:11.283 --> 00:33:14.480
There's nothing else
like it in the universe.

00:33:14.520 --> 00:33:16.351
I killed those plants...

00:33:16.389 --> 00:33:19.847
just like I almost killed Tuvok.

00:33:19.892 --> 00:33:21.951
But I don't want
to hurt anybody.

00:33:22.028 --> 00:33:24.121
Of course you don't.

00:33:24.163 --> 00:33:25.960
That's not the point.

00:33:25.998 --> 00:33:29.832
Hurt people, help them,
give life, kill...

00:33:29.869 --> 00:33:31.530
it's all the same.

00:33:31.570 --> 00:33:33.731
Once you see
beyond the physical,

00:33:33.773 --> 00:33:37.641
you see the universe
as it truly is.

00:33:37.677 --> 00:33:41.477
Now you know why you can't stay
with these people...

00:33:41.514 --> 00:33:43.982
why you have to come with me.

00:33:45.317 --> 00:33:47.285
Come back to the station.

00:33:47.319 --> 00:33:49.617
We'll care for you.

00:33:49.655 --> 00:33:51.247
We'll train you.

00:33:53.125 --> 00:33:55.389
Oh, I don't know.

00:34:01.634 --> 00:34:04.102
I still need some more time
to think about it.

00:34:04.136 --> 00:34:07.299
Take all the time you want.

00:34:07.339 --> 00:34:09.307
But when you meet Suspiria,

00:34:09.341 --> 00:34:10.535
I think you'll decide
to join us.

00:34:10.576 --> 00:34:12.476
Why?

00:34:12.511 --> 00:34:15.139
Because Suspiria is your future.

00:34:15.181 --> 00:34:18.617
She's part of us,
and we're a part of her.

00:34:18.651 --> 00:34:22.246
All the Ocampa here
are connected in a way

00:34:22.288 --> 00:34:26.281
that can't be put into
words, and if you develop

00:34:26.325 --> 00:34:28.589
your abilities far enough,

00:34:28.627 --> 00:34:32.996
Suspiria will invite you
to go with her to Exosia.

00:34:34.567 --> 00:34:35.625
Exosia?

00:34:35.668 --> 00:34:38.398
A place the humanoids
on this ship call

00:34:38.437 --> 00:34:41.201
"a subspace layer,"
a place of pure thought,

00:34:41.240 --> 00:34:45.540
pure energy,
a place of the mind.

00:34:45.578 --> 00:34:47.409
Think about it, Kes.

00:34:47.446 --> 00:34:50.882
When you're ready,
Suspiria will embrace you.

00:34:50.916 --> 00:34:52.907
Good night.

00:35:18.843 --> 00:35:19.935
Torres to Bridge.

00:35:19.977 --> 00:35:22.002
The Caretaker's remains
are resonating again.

00:35:25.216 --> 00:35:27.582
It's definitely reacting
to a sporocystian life-form,

00:35:27.618 --> 00:35:28.585
and from what I can tell,

00:35:28.619 --> 00:35:30.553
that life-form
is right on top of us.

00:35:30.588 --> 00:35:31.646
Acknowledged.

00:35:31.689 --> 00:35:32.849
Captain...

00:35:32.890 --> 00:35:35.586
there's a subspace rupture
forming directly ahead.

00:35:35.626 --> 00:35:36.593
Yellow Alert.

00:35:36.627 --> 00:35:37.594
Janeway to Tanis.

00:35:37.628 --> 00:35:38.890
Will you please
come to the Bridge?

00:35:38.929 --> 00:35:41.227
I believe we've made contact
with Suspiria.

00:35:41.265 --> 00:35:42.755
I know. I'm on my way.

00:35:44.602 --> 00:35:46.832
I think we should run
a biospectral analysis.

00:35:46.871 --> 00:35:49.305
Some of these readings
are pretty strange.

00:35:49.340 --> 00:35:52.332
And get me the sensor logs on
that subspace rupture out there.

00:35:54.578 --> 00:35:57.809
Captain, I'm picking up some
strange readings in Engineering.

00:35:57.848 --> 00:36:00.373
Some kind of plasmatic
energy field is forming.

00:36:00.418 --> 00:36:01.612
Janeway to Torres.

00:36:01.652 --> 00:36:03.517
We're picking up some odd
plasmatic readings down there.

00:36:03.554 --> 00:36:05.579
Can you confirm?

00:36:05.623 --> 00:36:07.056
Janeway to Torres.

00:36:08.459 --> 00:36:10.017
Security, meet me
in Main Engineering.

00:36:10.061 --> 00:36:11.085
Aye, sir.

00:36:35.786 --> 00:36:37.617
It's time to go.

00:36:37.655 --> 00:36:39.384
Go... where?

00:36:39.423 --> 00:36:41.687
Back to the Ocampa station.

00:36:41.726 --> 00:36:43.956
Everyone's waiting for you, Kes.

00:36:44.061 --> 00:36:45.289
The connection has been made.

00:36:45.329 --> 00:36:47.297
You're part of us now.

00:36:47.331 --> 00:36:49.925
Your future has already begun.

00:37:06.183 --> 00:37:07.810
Tuvok to Bridge.

00:37:07.852 --> 00:37:09.217
Go ahead.

00:37:09.253 --> 00:37:11.551
I believe the female Caretaker
is here.

00:37:11.589 --> 00:37:14.251
Commander, you have the Bridge.

00:37:19.330 --> 00:37:21.355
Can't you feel the connection?

00:37:21.398 --> 00:37:24.162
Your people are calling to you.

00:37:24.201 --> 00:37:26.066
Listen to them.

00:37:28.873 --> 00:37:30.534
Yes.

00:37:32.143 --> 00:37:34.338
I can hear them.

00:37:34.378 --> 00:37:36.278
All of them.

00:37:36.313 --> 00:37:38.338
And can you hear Suspiria?

00:37:56.066 --> 00:37:58.034
Tuvok?

00:38:08.612 --> 00:38:09.977
Who are you?

00:38:12.383 --> 00:38:14.476
Suspiria.

00:38:17.621 --> 00:38:21.022
I've been looking forward
to meeting you.

00:38:21.058 --> 00:38:22.821
Why?

00:38:22.860 --> 00:38:26.159
Because I had the opportunity
to talk to your companion

00:38:26.197 --> 00:38:28.062
before he died.

00:38:28.098 --> 00:38:30.498
Yes, I know.

00:38:30.534 --> 00:38:32.593
I can feel her presence.

00:38:32.636 --> 00:38:34.729
She's powerful...

00:38:34.772 --> 00:38:36.797
turbulent.

00:38:41.412 --> 00:38:44.176
She's upset.

00:38:44.215 --> 00:38:45.944
She's angry!

00:38:45.983 --> 00:38:47.974
Kes...

00:38:51.255 --> 00:38:53.849
She wants to destroy the ship!

00:38:53.891 --> 00:38:55.722
Kes, listen to me.

00:38:55.759 --> 00:38:56.783
There's nothing to worry about.

00:38:56.827 --> 00:38:58.795
Am I interrupting?

00:38:59.930 --> 00:39:02.296
He told us that you were curious

00:39:02.333 --> 00:39:04.631
and went off to explore
the galaxy.

00:39:04.668 --> 00:39:06.795
We're explorers, too,

00:39:06.837 --> 00:39:10.466
but your friend brought us to
this Quadrant against our will,

00:39:10.507 --> 00:39:12.771
and we haven't been able
to find a way back.

00:39:12.810 --> 00:39:15.040
Is that why you killed him?

00:39:15.079 --> 00:39:17.070
We didn't kill him.

00:39:17.114 --> 00:39:19.082
You destroyed the Array

00:39:19.116 --> 00:39:20.640
and you took his remains.

00:39:20.684 --> 00:39:22.276
- I assure you...
- No!

00:39:22.319 --> 00:39:25.345
You killed him.

00:39:25.389 --> 00:39:29.155
And now, I will kill you.

00:39:51.115 --> 00:39:55.814
Now you will know what frail,
small creatures you truly are.

00:40:06.664 --> 00:40:07.961
What's going on?

00:40:07.998 --> 00:40:09.625
I don't know.

00:40:09.667 --> 00:40:12.101
It's like the entire molecular
structure of the ship

00:40:12.136 --> 00:40:13.763
is coming apart.

00:40:13.804 --> 00:40:15.396
Red Alert.

00:40:15.439 --> 00:40:16.463
Bridge to Janeway.

00:40:17.608 --> 00:40:19.075
Bridge to Janeway.

00:40:20.778 --> 00:40:22.507
We're losing hull integrity.

00:40:22.546 --> 00:40:24.514
Increase power
to structural reinforcement.

00:40:24.548 --> 00:40:26.106
Aye, sir.

00:40:26.150 --> 00:40:28.311
Forget these people.
You're beyond them.

00:40:28.352 --> 00:40:29.649
No.

00:40:29.687 --> 00:40:31.552
Leave her alone, Tanis.

00:40:31.588 --> 00:40:34.557
Remember how you felt
in the airponics bay?

00:40:34.591 --> 00:40:37.992
You've never felt that way
in your entire life, have you?

00:40:38.095 --> 00:40:39.528
Get away from me.

00:40:39.563 --> 00:40:41.531
That was only the beginning,
Kes.

00:40:41.565 --> 00:40:43.123
I said leave her alone!

00:40:45.502 --> 00:40:46.526
Neelix!

00:40:46.570 --> 00:40:48.834
Leave him!
Leave him, Kes!

00:40:48.872 --> 00:40:51.238
He's nothing compared to you.

00:40:51.275 --> 00:40:52.469
Nothing!

00:40:52.509 --> 00:40:54.534
You have to trust.

00:41:18.569 --> 00:41:19.866
Oh, Neelix.

00:41:19.903 --> 00:41:21.632
Suspiria...

00:41:54.538 --> 00:41:57.905
So, now you kill me
as you did my mate.

00:41:57.941 --> 00:42:01.274
No. I told you
we didn't kill him.

00:42:02.880 --> 00:42:05.178
Please try to understand.

00:42:05.215 --> 00:42:07.183
We don't want to hurt you.

00:42:07.217 --> 00:42:09.185
We don't want to hurt anyone.

00:42:09.219 --> 00:42:12.120
We just want to get home.

00:42:19.329 --> 00:42:22.662
Tuvok, release the force field.

00:42:22.699 --> 00:42:24.496
Captain...

00:42:24.535 --> 00:42:25.900
Do it.

00:42:37.081 --> 00:42:40.710
You'd show me mercy
after what I did to you?

00:42:41.819 --> 00:42:45.118
Yes, I would.

00:43:05.909 --> 00:43:09.504
Take me with you... please.

00:43:14.985 --> 00:43:16.953
It appears she has descended
into subspace.

00:43:17.054 --> 00:43:18.180
Can you track her position?

00:43:18.222 --> 00:43:19.189
Negative.

00:43:19.223 --> 00:43:20.554
The rupture has been sealed.

00:43:23.594 --> 00:43:25.255
She is gone, Captain.

00:43:31.869 --> 00:43:33.769
Captain's Log, supplemental.

00:43:33.804 --> 00:43:36.466
We've resumed our course
back to the Alpha Quadrant,

00:43:36.507 --> 00:43:39.135
but the female Caretaker
is still out there

00:43:39.176 --> 00:43:41.303
with the power to send us home.

00:43:41.345 --> 00:43:43.609
And I will use all my power
to find her

00:43:43.647 --> 00:43:46.343
and convince her
to do just that.

00:43:49.419 --> 00:43:50.750
I looked at the tea

00:43:50.787 --> 00:43:53.085
and I tried to make it boil,
but nothing happened.

00:43:53.123 --> 00:43:55.819
Without Tanis' help,
I just can't do it.

00:43:55.859 --> 00:43:57.156
Nevertheless,

00:43:57.194 --> 00:43:59.992
your psychokinetic abilities
are still part of you.

00:44:00.030 --> 00:44:01.793
They might resurface one day.

00:44:01.832 --> 00:44:05.097
To be honest, I never want to
see that part of myself again.

00:44:05.135 --> 00:44:07.103
To which part are you referring?

00:44:07.137 --> 00:44:08.434
To the part of me

00:44:08.472 --> 00:44:10.167
that got pleasure
from destroying those plants

00:44:10.207 --> 00:44:11.572
in the airponics bay.

00:44:11.608 --> 00:44:14.304
To the part of me that was
tempted to go with Tanis.

00:44:14.344 --> 00:44:17.507
I never realized I had
such dark impulses.

00:44:17.548 --> 00:44:19.038
Without the darkness,

00:44:19.082 --> 00:44:21.050
how would we recognize
the light?

00:44:21.084 --> 00:44:23.609
Do not fear
your negative thoughts.

00:44:23.654 --> 00:44:25.178
They are part of you.

00:44:25.222 --> 00:44:27.690
They are a part
of every living being.

00:44:27.724 --> 00:44:28.884
Even Vulcans.

00:44:28.926 --> 00:44:30.120
You?

00:44:30.160 --> 00:44:34.187
The Vulcan heart was forged
out of barbarism and violence.

00:44:34.231 --> 00:44:36.199
We learned to control it.

00:44:36.233 --> 00:44:38.701
But it is still part of us.

00:44:38.735 --> 00:44:40.703
To pretend it does not exist

00:44:40.737 --> 00:44:43.865
is to create an opportunity
for it to escape.

00:44:43.907 --> 00:44:45.568
Let us begin.

00:44:55.319 --> 00:44:56.946
Open yourself

00:44:56.987 --> 00:44:59.421
to the impressions around you...

00:44:59.456 --> 00:45:04.052
the thoughts, the minds
that are on this ship.
